   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Faire + infinitive",
   "texto": [
    "**Faire** + infinitive means «make someone do something.» or «command to do»: **Je fais réparer ma voiture** (I control repair my car).",
    "**Je répare ma voiture** is not said if the repair is made by another person."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Place of pronouns",
   "texto": [
    "The pronouns go in front of **faire**: **Je la fais réparer** (the repair command). The infinitive does not change."
   ]
